
  XOS install medium

  To install XOS on this machine, type:

      install-xos

  It works out what hardware is here, asks which disk to use, and does the
  rest. Nothing is erased until you have seen the disk and typed its name
  back.

  Other things worth knowing:

      install-xos --dry-run     every question, nothing written
      xos hardware              what is in this machine, and what it needs
      iwctl                     connect to wifi
      ip a                      check the network

  There is a full manual at /root/xos/docs/manual.md.

